#: ../../source/interactive.rst:490
msgid "Jupyter 增强"
msgstr "Jupyter Enhancements"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:493
msgid ""
"PyODPS 针对 Jupyter 下的探索性数据分析进行了增强，包括结果探索功能以及"
"进度展示功能。"
msgstr ""
"PyODPS enhances features such as result exploration and progress display "
"in Jupyter."

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:497
msgid ""
"使用这些功能需要安装 ``ipywidgets`` 7.0 或以上版本，并正确安装和启用 "
"PyODPS 提供的 Jupyter 前端扩展 （安装包中同时提供了 JupyterLab 3.0+ 与"
"经典 Jupyter 6.0+ 的扩展）。选项 ``display.notebook_widget`` 默认为 ``"
"None``，表示自动判断：除 DSW 与 VSCode 内置的 Jupyter 外，交互式组件默认"
"开启。将其显式设置为 ``False`` 可关闭交互式组件，设置为 ``True`` 则强制"
"开启："
msgstr ""
"These features require ``ipywidgets`` 7.0 or later, with the PyODPS "
"Jupyter front end extension properly installed and enabled (the package "
"ships extensions for both JupyterLab 3.0+ and classic Jupyter 6.0+). "
"Interactive widgets are enabled by default except for DSW and Jupyter "
"inside VSCode; the ``display.notebook_widget`` option defaults to "
"``None`` to auto-detect this. Set it explicitly to ``False`` to turn "
"widgets off, or to ``True`` to force them on:"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:502
msgid ""
"from odps import options\n"
"\n"
"options.display.notebook_widget = False"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:508
msgid "结果探索"
msgstr "Result exploration"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:509
msgid ""
"PyODPS 为 DataFrame 结果提供了交互式的数据探索功能。当执行结果为 "
"DataFrame 时，PyODPS 会将其转换为 pandas DataFrame，并以交互式组件的形式"
"展示。组件顶端为模式选择区，除数据表外，还可以选择柱状图、饼图、折线图和"
"散点图。"
msgstr ""
"PyODPS provides an interactive data exploration feature for DataFrame "
"results. When the execution result is a DataFrame, PyODPS converts it to "
"a pandas DataFrame and displays it as an interactive widget. The top of "
"the widget is a mode selector; besides the data table, bar charts, pie "
"charts, line charts and scatter plots are available."

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:512
msgid ""
