"的翻页按钮在数据中导航，如下图："
msgstr ""
"In the data table mode, the result is displayed as a paged table showing "
"at most 10 rows per page; use the buttons at the bottom to navigate the "
"data, as shown below:"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:514
msgid ".. image:: _static/dfview-data-grid.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:516
msgid "在绘图模式下，单击右上角的配置按钮（齿轮图标）可以修改图表设置："
msgstr ""
"In a graph mode, click the configuration button (gear icon) on the top "
"right corner to change the chart settings:"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:518
msgid "分组：按列的取值将数据拆分为多个系列，仅柱状图、折线图和散点图支持；"
msgstr ""
"Groups: split the data into multiple series by column values. Only bar "
"charts, line charts and scatter plots support it;"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:519
msgid ""
"键：作为 X 轴类目（饼图中为扇区）的列，柱状图和饼图支持选择多个键，折线图"
"和散点图仅支持一个键，且可选择 ``(Row ID)`` 表示以行号作为 X 轴；"
msgstr ""
"Keys: the column used as the X-axis categories (sectors for pie charts). "
"Bar charts and pie charts allow multiple keys, while line charts and "
"scatter plots allow only one key, and ``(Row ID)`` can be selected to use"
" the row number as the X axis;"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:521
msgid ""
"值：作为度量的列。柱状图和饼图会对值列做聚合，可在字段下方选择聚合函数（"
"支持 count、nunique、min、max、 sum、mean、median、var、std），其中 sum、"
"mean、median、var、std 仅对数值列有意义，用于其他类型的列时会 自动回退为 "
"count；折线图和散点图直接使用所选列的值，不做聚合。"
msgstr ""
"Values: the columns used as measures. Bar charts and pie charts aggregate"
" the value columns, and an aggregate function can be chosen below each "
"field (count, nunique, min, max, sum, mean, median, var and std are "
"supported). sum, mean, median, var and std are only meaningful for "
"numeric columns and fall back to count for other types; line charts and "
"scatter plots use the selected columns as-is without aggregation."

