#: ../../source/interactive.rst:540
msgid ""
"修改配置后单击 Refresh 即可重新计算并绘制图表。请求尚未返回时，图表区域"
"显示 Loading...；当前显示的数据来自旧配置 时，则显示 Updating...。"
msgstr ""
"After changing the settings, click Refresh to recompute and redraw the "
"chart. While a request is still pending, the chart area shows Loading...;"
" when the displayed data comes from an old configuration, it shows "
"Updating...."

