msgid "**注意**\\ ：使用此功能需要安装 Pandas，并保证 ipywidgets 被正确安装。"
msgstr ""
"**Note**\\: You must have Pandas and ipywidgets properly installed to use"
" this feature."

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:548
msgid "进度展示"
msgstr "Progress display"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:550
#, python-format
msgid ""
"大型作业执行通常需要较长的时间，因而 PyODPS 提供了进度展示功能。当 "
"DataFrame 作业或通过 ``%sql`` 编写的 SQL 语句在 Jupyter 中执行作业时，会"
"显示当前正在执行的作业组链接（例如 ``Executing: summary``）及总体进度，"
"如下图："
msgstr ""
"The execution of large jobs usually takes a long time, so PyODPS provides"
" a progress display. When DataFrame jobs or SQL statements written with "
"``%sql`` are executing in Jupyter, a link to the running job group is "
"displayed (for example ``Executing: summary``) together with the overall "
"progress, as shown below:"

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:553
msgid ".. image:: _static/progress_example.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/interactive.rst:555
msgid ""
"单击作业组链接即可打开对话框，查看该组中每个 Instance 的状态、各 Task 的 "
"Stage 执行进度以及 Logview 链接。 对话框底部给出了 Stage 进度条三种颜色"
"对应的状态，如下图："
msgstr ""
"Clicking the job group link opens a dialog showing the status of each "
"Instance in the group, the Stage progress of each Task, and the Logview "
"links. The bottom of the dialog shows which state each of the three Stage"
" progress colours stands for, as shown below:"

